lothlorien.message.lore.saplings.outside=§7Dieser Setzling steht außerhalb des Goldenen Waldes; er zählt nicht.
## Context: The trader refuses a player whose Harmony is Shunned, including a player carrying a request. Peaceful conduct in the forest can restore access; no request form or trade screen opens.
lothlorien.message.trade.refused.shunned=§7Der Elf wird nicht mit dir handeln. Lerne, in Frieden mit dem Wald zu leben, und kehre dann zurück.
## Context: The trader refuses a player whose Harmony is Hated, including a player carrying a request. No request form or trade screen opens.
lothlorien.message.trade.refused.hated=§7Der Elf wendet sich ab und wird nicht mit dir handeln.
## Context: The elf’s offers are prepared for this player. The player must interact with the same elf again to open the native trade screen; selecting Trade in a request form grants a short pass for this next interaction.
lothlorien.message.trade.again=§7Der Elf ist zum Handeln bereit. Interagiere erneut mit ihm.
## Context: Button in a trader’s request form. It closes the form and permits the player’s next interaction with this elf to open the native trade screen; the request remains active.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.trade=Handeln
## Context: Developer diagnostic for the nearest trader: localized profession, its current table key, the invoking player’s eligible key and current trade-pass state. Technical keys and pass values are supplied verbatim.
lothlorien.message.trade.debug=Handelsdiagnose: %s, Tabelle %s, deine %s, Freigabe %s
## Context: Selecting Trade closes the request form. The player must then click the same elf again to open the native trade screen. This instruction is shown before selecting the button.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.trade_hint=Danach den Elfen erneut anklicken
## Context: Chest armour with leather-level protection. Grants invisibility after sneaking without moving for one second.
item.lothlorien:elven_cloak=Elbenumhang
## Context: Elven bow with a faster draw, native bow enchantments and vanilla arrow flight. Galadhrim is a lore proper name.
item.lothlorien:bow=Bogen der Galadhrim
## Context: Off-hand gift rendered at the waist; grants Regeneration I while health is strictly below half maximum.
item.lothlorien:silver_belt=Silbergürtel
## Context: Off-hand gift that lights nearby air and repels spiders. Galadriel is a lore proper name; phial means a small vial.
item.lothlorien:phial_of_galadriel=Galadriels Phiole
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
item.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow=Galadhrim-Pfeil
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
entity.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow.name=Galadhrim-Pfeil
## Context: Invisible temporary air-space light used by the Phial of Galadriel; hidden from creative inventory and drops nothing.
tile.lothlorien:phial_light.name=Phiolenlicht
